{"seq":2,"slug":"controlnet-and-adapters","title":"ControlNet 与适配器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/controlnet-and-adapters","wordCount":1459,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"controlnet-与适配器\">ControlNet 与适配器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ControlNet 和各类适配器技术解决的核心问题是：如何在不重新训练基础模型的前提下，为预训练的文本到图像模型添加精确的空间控制能力。标准的文本提示难以精确描述物体的姿态、边缘、深度等空间信息，而 ControlNet 通过添加条件分支网络，允许用户以边缘图、深度图、姿态骨架等结构化信息为条件来引导生成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T[文本提示] --&gt; BASE[基础 U-Net]&#10;    COND[控制条件] --&gt; CN[ControlNet 分支]&#10;    CN --&gt;|零卷积| BASE&#10;    BASE --&gt; OUT[生成图像]&#10;    N[噪声] --&gt; BASE\">graph LR\n    T[文本提示] --&gt; BASE[基础 U-Net]\n    COND[控制条件] --&gt; CN[ControlNet 分支]\n    CN --&gt;|零卷积| BASE\n    BASE --&gt; OUT[生成图像]\n    N[噪声] --&gt; BASE</pre><p>ControlNet 的设计哲学是&quot;不破坏原有能力&quot;。通过克隆基础模型的编码器并使用零卷积（zero convolution）连接，ControlNet 在训练初期对基础模型的输出几乎没有影响，随着训练进行逐步学习条件控制能力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>控制类型</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>控制精度</th>\n<th>兼容性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ControlNet</td>\n<td>空间条件</td>\n<td>~360M</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>特定基础模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T2I-Adapter</td>\n<td>空间条件</td>\n<td>~70M</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP-Adapter</td>\n<td>图像风格/内容</td>\n<td>~22M</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>风格/概念微调</td>\n<td>~4-100M</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Textual Inversion</td>\n<td>概念嵌入</td>\n<td>~几KB</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"controlnet-架构与零卷积\">ControlNet 架构与零卷积</h2><p>ControlNet 的架构设计精妙而优雅。它将预训练 U-Net 的编码器完整克隆一份作为可训练的条件分支，冻结原始 U-Net 的所有参数。条件图像（如 Canny 边缘图）通过浅层卷积编码后输入条件分支，条件分支的各层输出通过零卷积（初始权重和偏置均为零的 1×1 卷积）叠加到原始 U-Net 对应层的输出上。</p>\n<p>零卷积是 ControlNet 成功的关键技巧。由于初始权重为零，训练开始时条件分支对基础模型的输出完全没有影响，保护了预训练模型已学到的生成能力。随着训练进行，零卷积的参数从零开始缓慢增长，条件分支逐步影响生成过程。这种&quot;从零开始学习控制&quot;的策略比直接在预训练模型上微调更加安全和稳定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline, ControlNetModel&#10;from diffusers.utils import load_image&#10;import torch&#10;from PIL import Image&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;controlnet = ControlNetModel.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;lllyasviel/sd-controlnet-canny&quot;, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;)&#10;pipe = StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5&quot;,&#10;    controlnet=controlnet,&#10;    torch_dtype=torch.float16,&#10;).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;&#10;def get_canny_image(image, low=100, high=200):&#10;    import cv2&#10;    image_np = np.array(image)&#10;    edges = cv2.Canny(image_np, low, high)&#10;    return Image.fromarray(edges)&#10;&#10;control_image = get_canny_image(load_image(&quot;input.png&quot;))&#10;image = pipe(&#10;    prompt=&quot;a beautiful house in a garden, high quality, detailed&quot;,&#10;    image=control_image,&#10;    num_inference_steps=30,&#10;    guidance_scale=7.5,&#10;).images[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline, ControlNetModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers.utils </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PIL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">controlnet </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ControlNetModel.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"lllyasviel/sd-controlnet-canny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    controlnet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">controlnet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_canny_image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(image, low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    image_np </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Canny(image_np, low, high)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image.fromarray(edges)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">control_image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_canny_image(load_image(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a beautiful house in a garden, high quality, detailed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">control_image,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ControlNet 支持多种控制条件：Canny 边缘（精确轮廓控制）、深度图（空间结构控制）、OpenPose 骨架（人体姿态控制）、语义分割图（区域语义控制）、法线贴图（表面方向控制）和涂鸦（草图创意控制）。多个 ControlNet 可以同时使用，通过加权组合实现复合条件控制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 多 ControlNet 组合&#10;        C1[Canny 边缘] --&gt; CN1[ControlNet 1]&#10;        C2[深度图] --&gt; CN2[ControlNet 2]&#10;        C3[OpenPose] --&gt; CN3[ControlNet 3]&#10;        CN1 --&gt;|权重 w₁| SUM[加权求和]&#10;        CN2 --&gt;|权重 w₂| SUM&#10;        CN3 --&gt;|权重 w₃| SUM&#10;        SUM --&gt; UNET[基础 U-Net]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 多 ControlNet 组合\n        C1[Canny 边缘] --&gt; CN1[ControlNet 1]\n        C2[深度图] --&gt; CN2[ControlNet 2]\n        C3[OpenPose] --&gt; CN3[ControlNet 3]\n        CN1 --&gt;|权重 w₁| SUM[加权求和]\n        CN2 --&gt;|权重 w₂| SUM\n        CN3 --&gt;|权重 w₃| SUM\n        SUM --&gt; UNET[基础 U-Net]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"ip-adapter-与图像条件注入\">IP-Adapter 与图像条件注入</h2><p>IP-Adapter（Image Prompt Adapter）使用参考图像作为条件，将图像的风格、内容或两者同时注入到生成过程中。与 ControlNet 通过特征叠加不同，IP-Adapter 通过额外的交叉注意力层实现图像条件注入。参考图像经过 CLIP 图像编码器得到图像嵌入，然后通过可训练的投影层转化为与文本嵌入兼容的 Key 和 Value。</p>\n<p>IP-Adapter 的训练只需更新投影层和新增的交叉注意力层，基础模型完全冻结。由于参数量很小（约 22M），训练成本远低于 ControlNet。更重要的是，IP-Adapter 可以与 ControlNet 同时使用——IP-Adapter 提供风格引导，ControlNet 提供结构控制，文本提示提供语义描述。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import StableDiffusionPipeline&#10;from transformers import CLIPVisionModelWithProjection, CLIPImageProcessor&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;class IPAdapterInference:&#10;    def __init__(self, pipe, ip_adapter_path):&#10;        self.pipe = pipe&#10;        self.image_encoder = CLIPVisionModelWithProjection.from_pretrained(&#10;            &quot;openai/clip-vit-large-patch14&quot;&#10;        ).to(pipe.device)&#10;        self.image_processor = CLIPImageProcessor()&#10;        self.pipe.load_ip_adapter(ip_adapter_path, subfolder=&quot;&quot;, weight_name=&quot;ip-adapter_sd15.bin&quot;)&#10;&#10;    def generate(self, prompt, reference_image, ip_scale=0.6):&#10;        self.pipe.set_ip_adapter_scale(ip_scale)&#10;        image = self.pipe(&#10;            prompt=prompt,&#10;            ip_adapter_image=reference_image,&#10;            num_inference_steps=30,&#10;            guidance_scale=7.5,&#10;        ).images[0]&#10;        return image\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionPipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLIPVisionModelWithProjection, CLIPImageProcessor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IPAdapterInference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, pipe, ip_adapter_path):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLIPVisionModelWithProjection.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"openai/clip-vit-large-patch14\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ).to(pipe.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CLIPImageProcessor()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe.load_ip_adapter(ip_adapter_path, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subfolder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ip-adapter_sd15.bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, prompt, reference_image, ip_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe.set_ip_adapter_scale(ip_scale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            ip_adapter_image</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reference_image,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image</span></span></code></pre></div><p>IP-Adapter 的权重参数（ip_scale）控制参考图像对生成结果的影响程度。较低的值保留更多文本控制，较高的值更多地跟随参考图像的风格。IP-Adapter-FaceID 是针对人脸的变体，使用 InsightFace 的人脸特征替代 CLIP 图像特征，实现精确的面部特征保持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"t2i-adapter-与轻量级控制\">T2I-Adapter 与轻量级控制</h2><p>T2I-Adapter 是 ControlNet 的轻量级替代方案。与 ControlNet 克隆整个 U-Net 编码器不同，T2I-Adapter 使用小型的条件编码器（约 70M 参数，仅为 ControlNet 的 1/5），将条件信息编码为多尺度特征图后直接加到 U-Net 的对应层上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ControlNet</th>\n<th>T2I-Adapter</th>\n<th>IP-Adapter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td>~360M</td>\n<td>~70M</td>\n<td>~22M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制类型</td>\n<td>空间结构</td>\n<td>空间结构</td>\n<td>风格/内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注入方式</td>\n<td>零卷积+特征叠加</td>\n<td>直接特征相加</td>\n<td>交叉注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练数据需求</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多条件组合</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 LoRA 兼容</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）和 Textual Inversion 是两种更轻量的个性化方法。LoRA 通过低秩矩阵分解在注意力层注入可训练参数，实现风格和概念的微调；Textual Inversion 只训练一个新的文本嵌入向量来表示目标概念，参数量仅为几 KB。这些方法可以与 ControlNet/IP-Adapter 自由组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制条件预处理管线\">控制条件预处理管线</h2><p>在实际应用中，控制条件的提取质量直接影响生成结果。不同的控制类型需要不同的预处理算法，选择合适的预处理器和参数是实现精确控制的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from PIL import Image&#10;&#10;def preprocess_canny(image, low_threshold=100, high_threshold=200):&#10;    image_np = np.array(image.convert(&quot;L&quot;))&#10;    edges = cv2.Canny(image_np, low_threshold, high_threshold)&#10;    return Image.fromarray(edges)&#10;&#10;def preprocess_depth(image, model_type=&quot;MiDaS_small&quot;):&#10;    import torch&#10;    midas = torch.hub.load(&quot;intel-isl/MiDaS&quot;, model_type)&#10;    midas.eval()&#10;    transform = torch.hub.load(&quot;intel-isl/MiDaS&quot;, &quot;transforms&quot;).small_transform&#10;    img = transform(np.array(image)).unsqueeze(0)&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        depth = midas(img)&#10;    depth = depth.squeeze().numpy()&#10;    depth = (depth - depth.min()) / (depth.max() - depth.min()) * 255&#10;    return Image.fromarray(depth.astype(np.uint8))&#10;&#10;def preprocess_hed(image):&#10;    from controlnet_aux import HEDdetector&#10;    hed = HEDdetector.from_pretrained(&quot;lllyasviel/Annotators&quot;)&#10;    return hed(image)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PIL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preprocess_canny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(image, low_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, high_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    image_np </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(image.convert(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Canny(image_np, low_threshold, high_threshold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image.fromarray(edges)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preprocess_depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(image, model_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MiDaS_small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    midas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.hub.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intel-isl/MiDaS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, model_type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    midas.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.hub.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intel-isl/MiDaS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transforms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).small_transform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    img </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transform(np.array(image)).unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> midas(img)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth.squeeze().numpy()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth.min()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (depth.max() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth.min()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 255</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image.fromarray(depth.astype(np.uint8))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preprocess_hed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(image):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controlnet_aux </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HEDdetector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HEDdetector.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lllyasviel/Annotators\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hed(image)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>预处理质量的常见问题包括：Canny 阈值不当导致边缘过多或过少、深度估计在透明物体和反射面上失效、OpenPose 在遮挡场景下姿态检测错误。在生产环境中，通常需要对预处理结果进行人工检查和调整，或使用多种预处理器的集成结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((ControlNet 与适配器))&#10;    ControlNet&#10;      零卷积设计&#10;      多条件类型&#10;      高精度控制&#10;    IP-Adapter&#10;      图像条件注入&#10;      交叉注意力&#10;      风格迁移&#10;    轻量方法&#10;      T2I-Adapter&#10;      LoRA&#10;      Textual Inversion&#10;    工程实践&#10;      预处理管线&#10;      多条件组合&#10;      参数调优\">mindmap\n  root((ControlNet 与适配器))\n    ControlNet\n      零卷积设计\n      多条件类型\n      高精度控制\n    IP-Adapter\n      图像条件注入\n      交叉注意力\n      风格迁移\n    轻量方法\n      T2I-Adapter\n      LoRA\n      Textual Inversion\n    工程实践\n      预处理管线\n      多条件组合\n      参数调优</pre><ul>\n<li>ControlNet 通过零卷积和编码器克隆实现安全的条件注入，支持多种空间控制类型</li>\n<li>IP-Adapter 通过交叉注意力注入参考图像特征，实现轻量级的风格和内容控制</li>\n<li>T2I-Adapter 是 ControlNet 的轻量替代，适合计算资源受限的场景</li>\n<li>多种控制方法可以自由组合，同时利用文本、空间结构和参考图像三维条件</li>\n<li>控制条件的预处理质量直接影响生成结果，需要针对具体场景选择合适的预处理器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ControlNet 与适配器","id":"controlnet-与适配器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ControlNet 架构与零卷积","id":"controlnet-架构与零卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"IP-Adapter 与图像条件注入","id":"ip-adapter-与图像条件注入"},{"level":2,"text":"T2I-Adapter 与轻量级控制","id":"t2i-adapter-与轻量级控制"},{"level":2,"text":"控制条件预处理管线","id":"控制条件预处理管线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文图架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/text-image-architecture"},"next":{"title":"图像编辑技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-editing"}}